    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 15th level, your hive has perfected the ability to work together in tandem with you as their master.</p>\n<p>You learn the Telekinesis creation; however, instead of magical force, your swarm is the thing lifting things. This creation does not count towards the maximum number of creations you know.</p>\n<p>You can use the Telekinesis creation at will, but only when targeting objects that aren't being worn or carried.</p>",
